      "message": "Have you considered adding  `Test Setup    Navigate To Factory Reset Page` instead of calling `Navigate To Required Sub Menu  ${xpath_settings_menu}  ${xpath_factory_reset_sub_menu}  factory-reset` in each test case?\n\nThe existing `gui/gui_test/settings_menu/test_date_and_time_sub_menu.robot` already follows this pattern. This avoids repeating the same navigation call in every test case and makes future changes, such as the menu path or arguments, a single-point update.\n\nFor example, in `test_factory_reset_sub_menu.robot`, you could add:\n\n```robot\n*** Settings ***\n...\nTest Setup    Navigate To Factory Reset Page\n```\n\nFor test cases that override the default setup, such as those that need `Power Off Server`, you can include the navigation in the `[Setup]` using `Run Keywords`:\n\n```robot\n[Setup]  Run Keywords  Power Off Server  AND  Navigate To Factory Reset Page\n```",
